<title>INDIA: Indian soybean markets closed for Hindu festival.</title>
<headline>Indian soybean markets closed for Hindu festival.</headline>
<dateline>INDORE, India 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian soybean markets were closed on Thursday for a Hindu festival, dealers said.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Friday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, soybean prices were strong on poor availability, but soyoil was steady in thin trade.</p>
</text>
